oit international. Les discussions devront ensuite se poursuivre pour aboutir à un accord complet et robuste sur les autres sujets, en particulier sur le programme nucléaire et balistique, et la stabilité régionale.\n\nLa France se tient prête à y prendre toute sa…","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":4991,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2060798742945562929","post_id":"2060798742945562929","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2060798742945562929","published_at":"2026-05-30T19:01:22.764Z","published_date":"2026-05-30","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Une nouvelle étoile brille sur Paris ! Bravo au PSG qui fait rêver toute l’Europe. La France est fière.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":47286,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known