c-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2060084508485931520","post_id":"2060084508485931520","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2060084508485931520","published_at":"2026-05-28T19:43:15.999Z","published_date":"2026-05-28","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Très heureux de vous accueillir à Paris, cher Président @Prabowo, pour cette visite d'État, preuve de la dynamique exceptionnelle entre nos deux pays.\n\nL'Indonésie est un partenaire majeur de la France, c'est pourquoi nous avons décidé de rehausser notre partenariat stratégique.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":1800,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2059728731640320294","post_id":"2059728731640320294","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2059728731640320294","published_at":"2026-05-27T20:09:32.189Z","published_date":"2026-05-27","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Bienvenue à Paris, cher @jonasgahrstore. \n                                            \nAprès ma visite à Olso en juin et la signature de notre partenariat stratégique, la Norvège et la France approfondissent encore leur coopération.\n                        \nEn matière de défense et de sécurité, en l’inscrivant notamment dans le cadre de la dissuasion avancée par un nouvel arrangement de défense.\n\nEn avançant aussi sur l’énergie, l’espace et l’industrie.\n\nFace aux menaces sur notre continent et au-delà, les Européens ont besoin d’être plus forts et plus souverains. Notre partenariat renforcé vient le démontrer.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":1767,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2059632739448508923","post_id":"2059632739448508923","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2059632739448508923","published_at":"2026-05-27T13:48:05.867Z","published_date":"2026-05-27","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Heureux de recevoir Roumen Radev, Premier ministre de Bulgarie.\n\nDéfense et sécurité, énergie, compétitivité, nous renforçons notre partenariat et œuvrons ensemble à une Europe plus souveraine et plus unie.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":1334,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2059627215780753597","post_id":"2059627215780753597","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2059627215780753597","published_at":"2026-05-27T13:26:08.922Z","published_date":"2026-05-27","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Bienvenue, cher @MickeySpajic.\n                          \nNous renforçons aujourd’hui la relation entre le Monténégro et la France dans plusieurs secteurs stratégiques, notamment de l’économie et des transports.\n                     \nLa France est aux côtés du peuple monténégrin pour l’accompagner sur le chemin de l’intégration européenne.\n\nÀ très bientôt au Monténégro !","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":1674,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-2059260023600042037","post_id":"2059260023600042037","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2059260023600042037","published_at":"2026-05-26T13:07:03.484Z","published_date":"2026-05-26","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Notre indépendance se construit par notre électricité.\n       \nÀ Belfort, en 2022, j’ai fixé le cap : sortir progressivement des énergies fossiles grâce à une électricité décarbonée, produite en France. Pour y arriver, toute l’Équipe de France de l’électrification se mobilise.\n\nC’est très concret :\n\n⚡️ Plus de véhicules électriques accessibles : nous poursuivons le leasing social, qui a déjà permis à 100 000 Français modestes, en particulier en zone rurale, de passer à l’électrique. 50 000 nouveaux ménages pourront en bénéficier. Rendez-vous sur mon-leasing-electrique.gouv.….  \n\n⚡️ Plus de voitures électriques françaises : Renault produit à Douai et Maubeuge ; Stellantis investit dans une nouvelle usine à Mulhouse pour produire des modèles électriques de nouvelle génération d’ici 2029. Ce…","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":2856,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":true},{"id":"x-2058989344405197067","post_id":"2058989344405197067","platform":"x","author":"EmmanuelMacron","original_url":"https://x.com/EmmanuelMacron/status/2058989344405197067","published_at":"2026-05-25T19:11:28.535Z","published_date":"2026-05-25","date_precision":"millisecond","source_ids":["nitter-public-timeline"],"text":"Heureux d’avoir échangé avec le Premier ministre thaïlandais Anutin Charnvirakul à l’occasion de sa visite en France.\n        \n170 ans après l’établissement de nos relations diplomatiques, la Thaïlande et la France continuent de faire vivre un partenariat fondé sur la confiance, des liens culturels étroits et des coopérations économiques, scientifiques et de sécurité, utiles au renforcement de nos souverainetés.","post_kind":"original","is_repost":false,"author_verified":true,"like_count":1877,"likes_captured_at":"2026-10-28T23:51:54.990547+00:00","likes_source":{"provider":"nitter-public-timeline","url":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","sha256":"6f6d90d7764ca40f54342a7701b5d7652cb5555b6e9f87346ccd8442cdd16fef","count_precision":"exact-displayed-integer","capture_precision":"collection-run-start","selection_policy":"latest-known-snapshot; minimum on same-time conflict"},"text_status":"captured_displayed_source_text","text_source":"https://nitter.jaydenha.uk/EmmanuelMacron/with_replies?cursor=DAAHCgABHVwYz2I__oMLAAIAAAATMjA2MTQ1MDA3MTcyMDMwODkyNAgAAwAAAAIAAA","text_truncated":false},{"id":"x-20586643182546988